{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/951ffc09c4ef29215989d8660aa6305c.poster.avif?t=1769176617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/951ffc09c4ef29215989d8660aa6305c.webm?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/951ffc09c4ef29215989d8660aa6305c.mp4?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, minimalist turn-based combat focused on positioning and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No randomness - outcome depends on strategy, timing, and ability use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a small tactical puzzle: tight quarters, limited turns, and space management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of unique raiders, each with specialized movement, perks, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and combine abilities like pushing, pulling, swapping, cloning, and teleporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize unit powers to manipulate the battlefield and optimize your loot runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your crew, increase loot capacity, and discover stronger units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost the quality and rarity of rewards by improving key ship systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful artifacts with unique passive effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/b4297d1d113989264e9d152420cd9611.poster.avif?t=1769176617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/b4297d1d113989264e9d152420cd9611.webm?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/b4297d1d113989264e9d152420cd9611.mp4?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 starting units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >160+ unit perks, skills, and movement types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 difficulties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/c3a785d868b22e5bf1cde0d425f28307.poster.avif?t=1769176617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/c3a785d868b22e5bf1cde0d425f28307.webm?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/c3a785d868b22e5bf1cde0d425f28307.mp4?t=1769176617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aspiring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531610/5fa42b6bbc093923d4d4605d9aedd9130842e367.jpg"},{"name":"Generalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531610/8dc7ee31633d3e674c44f